WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.268 --> 00:00:06.640 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ses plaies. Mathieu Gohier.

00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:07.508 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Des chants,

00:00:05.973 --> 00:00:08.308 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la sauge brûlée, un hommage

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:12.145 size:53% position:73% line:53%
spontané aux 215 enfants enlevés

00:00:07.808 --> 00:00:12.145 size:53% position:73% line:53%
