00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:25.926 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ivy Chelsea s'est rendue sur

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:27.461 size:53% position:73% line:53%
place pour que les esprits

00:00:24.725 --> 00:00:28.996 size:53% position:73% line:53%
