00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:47.514 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Même si, à Kamloops,

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:49.049 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'histoire du pensionnat est

00:00:46.313 --> 00:00:50.584 size:53% position:73% line:53%
