00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:52.085 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dépasse l'entendement.

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:53.620 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Devant le bâtiment, le monument

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:55.122 size:53% position:73% line:53%
commémoratif aux élèves

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:56.657 size:53% position:73% line:53%
autochtones est devenu un lieu

00:00:53.921 --> 00:00:58.158 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de recueillement.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:59.660 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Autochtones et blancs

00:00:56.957 --> 00:01:02.129 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se succèdent pour y déposer

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:02.129 size:53% position:73% line:53%
