00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.129 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la mémoire des disparus.

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:19.880 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Pour la communauté

00:01:17.144 --> 00:01:21.381 size:53% position:73% line:53%
