00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:22.916 size:53% position:73% line:53%
beaucoup de questions

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.418 size:53% position:73% line:53%
demeurent sans réponse.

00:01:21.682 --> 00:01:26.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais la Première Nation est

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:26.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
déterminée à faire toute la

00:01:24.718 --> 00:01:26.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lumière sur ces disparitions.

00:01:35.262 --> 00:01:39.499 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Encore sous le choc

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:41.034 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et la douleur, la communauté

00:01:38.265 --> 00:01:42.536 size:53% position:73% line:53%
